  "title": {
   "en": "Hebigami-Kun Wa Samui To Henshin Shichau kara"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "蛇神くんは寒いと変身しちゃうから"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The transfer student, Hebigami-kun, has a peculiar trait: when he gets cold, he turns into a snake.\n\nMysterious and feared by everyone, only his seatmate Haruna knows that he's actually kind-hearted. Unless his body temperature rises, Hebigami-kun can’t return to his human form. Haruna starts to worry about him and tries to keep him warm.\n\n(Source: Pixiv Comic, translated)",
   "ja": "転校生の蛇神くんは、寒いとヘビになる体質。\nミステリアスでみんなから怖がられているけど、本当は優しいことを隣の席の春名さんだけは知っている。\n体温が上がらないと、人間には戻れない蛇神くん。\n春名さんは、そんな彼をあっためようと気にかけるようになって…!?\n人外男子と普通の女子高生の、じわじわ体温上昇系青春ラブコメ♪"
  },
